</div></div></main><!-- close content main element --></div></div></div><div class="avia-section av-m4czdtng-d6627fd38c22d0df2efb1be85e3f61b6 header_color avia-section-default avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-2 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_2"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-996"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
<div class="flex_column_table av-m4h8213l-af95786a7c8e666d1df7548f4d0bedeb sc-av_one_full av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-m4h8213l-af95786a7c8e666d1df7548f4d0bedeb av_one_full avia-builder-el-3 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-bottom"><section class="av_textblock_section av-m4cyajx3-f1cf5da66b4b527a9464443a83a08bbc" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>At <a href="/">Casa Privée</a>, we’re redefining what it means to live confidently and comfortably. We specialize in cutting-edge, non-invasive treatments that empower our patients to take control of their wellness journey. One of our most innovative offerings is the BTL EMSELLA Chair, also known as the “Kegel Throne.” This revolutionary device is designed to help with urinary incontinence in both men and women, offering a life-changing solution without the need for surgery, downtime, or discomfort.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --><div class="flex_column_table av-aokwk-ab7d460378885ee808ef5fd5324169e9 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-aokwk-ab7d460378885ee808ef5fd5324169e9 av_one_half avia-builder-el-5 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-bottom column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m5sm04uk-b9e693ad52ee63810a42a6750e8355a7 av-special-heading-h2 blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-6 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h2 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">What Makes the Kegal Throne a Game-Changer?  </h2><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m5slzwq3-baf5962d5a2ca71dd71a396b4debf9dc" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>Imagine a treatment for urinary incontinence that’s effortless, effective, and fits into your busy lifestyle. That’s exactly what our treatment for pelvic floor dysfunction delivers. During each session, you simply sit back and relax in the fully clothed comfort of our luxurious private clinic. The chair uses advanced electromagnetic technology to stimulate the muscles of your pelvic floor, triggering thousands of powerful contractions—far beyond what traditional Kegel exercises can achieve.</p>
<p>In just 30 minutes, you’ll experience the equivalent of over 11,000 Kegel exercises, with all the critical muscles in the pelvic region engaged simultaneously. These deep, focused contractions work to restore strength, improve neuromuscular control, and revitalize the pelvic floor area. Whether your symptoms are mild or severe, the high-intensity focused electromagnetic (HIFEM) chair provides a transformative, non-surgical solution for bladder leaks, age-related concerns, or pelvic floor issues resulting from childbirth.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-blcx7-8e298f9275f4a7f8d2086b1d99dd1a96 av_one_half avia-builder-el-8 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-bottom column-top-margin"><div class="avia-image-container av-m4ebrt5y-6f614ef14f59a1896a8d03dc0c5efbb7 av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-9 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="The Emsella chair therapy in Miami is a non-surgical option to strengthen your pelvic floor. Therapy in Miami for treating urinary incontinence. Treatment at Casa Privée." class="wp-image-1014 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1014 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="822" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 756px) 100vw, 756px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/em-chair-001.jpg" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/em-chair-001.jpg 756w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/em-chair-001-276x300.jpg 276w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/01/em-chair-001-648x705.jpg 648w" title="Chair" width="756"/></div></div></div></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 --></div></div></div><!-- close content main div --></div></div><div class="avia-section av-m4d1j0tp-cd0584b9ef928180544ee86ab7b646bf main_color avia-section-large avia-no-border-styling avia-builder-el-10 el_after_av_section el_before_av_section avia-bg-style-scroll container_wrap fullsize" id="av_section_3"><div class="container av-section-cont-open"><div class="template-page content av-content-full alpha units"><div class="post-entry post-entry-type-page post-entry-996"><div class="entry-content-wrapper clearfix">
